# Workflow: Adding a New Feature

> Apply this checklist for every new feature. Check each step — do not skip.

## Checklist

### Before coding

- [ ] Create spec at `specs/features/<name>/spec.md` (use template from `specs/_template.md`)
- [ ] Resolve all Open Questions in spec before implementing
- [ ] Create `plan.md` and `tasks.md` from the spec

### While coding

- [ ] Place files in the correct directory according to `docs/core-principles-and-coding-standards/structure.md`
- [ ] Follow patterns in `docs/core-principles-and-coding-standards/coding-conventions.md`
- [ ] Write unit tests for important logic

### Before reporting done

- [ ] `{{PACKAGE_MANAGER}} run lint` — must pass, no warnings
- [ ] `{{PACKAGE_MANAGER}} run test` — 100% pass
- [ ] All Acceptance Criteria in `spec.md` checked off
- [ ] Create `review.md` summarizing what was done and lessons learned
- [ ] Move spec folder to `specs/features/done/`
